{"id": "3142428", "revid": "38389", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3142428", "title": "1903 \u00een art\u0103", "text": "__FARACUPRINS__\n\u2190 1900 \u00een art\u0103 \u2014 1901 \u00een art\u0103 \u2014 1902 \u00een art\u0103 \u2014\u2014 \" 1903 \u00een art\u0103 \" \u2014\u2014 1904 \u00een art\u0103 \u2014 1905 \u00een art\u0103 \u2014 1906 \u00een art\u0103 \u2192\n1903 \u00een art\u0103 implic\u0103 o serie de evenimente:\nEvenimente.\nEvenimente artistice oriunde.\nF\u0103r\u0103 date precise,\n\"Perioada Albastr\u0103,\" care va fi urmat\u0103 de \"Perioada Roz\" (, 1904 - 1907) este considerat\u0103 ca fiind prima mare etap\u0103 din evolu\u021bia artistic\u0103 a artistului vizual spaniol.\nP\u00e2n\u0103 \u00een 1914, anul declan\u0219\u0103rii Primului R\u0103zboi Mondial, asocierea a fost foarte activ\u0103 \u0219i lucrativ\u0103, adun\u00e2nd \u00eempreun\u0103 numero\u0219i arti\u0219ti plasticii de varii orient\u0103ri, arhitec\u021bi, cerami\u0219ti, designeri, realizatori de mobilier, graficieni, aurari \u0219i argintari, precum \u0219i al\u021bii.\nLeg\u0103turi externe.\n&lt;br&gt;"}
{"id": "3142429", "revid": "38389", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3142429", "title": "1902 \u00een art\u0103", "text": "__FARACUPRINS__\n\u2190 1899 \u00een art\u0103 \u2014 1900 \u00een art\u0103 \u2014 1901 \u00een art\u0103 \u2014\u2014 \" 1902 \u00een art\u0103 \" \u2014\u2014 1903 \u00een art\u0103 \u2014 1904 \u00een art\u0103 \u2014 1905 \u00een art\u0103 \u2192\n1902 \u00een art\u0103 implic\u0103 o serie de evenimente:\nEvenimente.\nEvenimente artistice oriunde.\nF\u0103r\u0103 date precise,\n\"Perioada Albastr\u0103\" va fi urmat\u0103 de \"Perioadei Roz\" (, 1904 - 1907), a doua mare etap\u0103 artistic\u0103. din cele zece perioade, din cariera marelui artist plastic spaniol.\nLeg\u0103turi externe.\n&lt;br&gt;"}
